  "title": "Chocolate SunButter® Scotcheroos",
  "description": "Crunchy, gooey and delicious! These chocolate scotcheroos are just like the original--but made better by including SunButter®!",
  "authors": [
    "SunButter"
  ],
  "date_published": "2017-05-11T02:59:51-04:00",
